---
title: Sign-up, Approval, Authentication, and Ownership
---
flowchart LR
    Visitor([Browser user]) --> Entry[Sign in, ask for access,<br/>or redeem an invite]
    Entry -->|ask for access: name, username,<br/>password, phone in E.164| Request[Access request API<br/>number claimed once]
    Request --> Requests[(Access requests<br/>phone sealed, keyed digest,<br/>password already hashed)]
    Entry -->|invite code| Register[Registration API]
    Entry -->|existing profile| Login[Login API]

    Operator([Operator]) --> Approve[Approve in admin]
    Operator --> CLI[Account CLI]
    CLI -->|create one-time code| Invites[(Registration invites<br/>digest and expiry only)]
    Invites -->|lock and consume once| Register
    Requests --> Approve
    Approve -->|account from the stored hash| Accounts[(Accounts<br/>stable owner)]
    Approve -->|enrol the number| Subscribers[(Subscribers<br/>one number, one account)]
    Approve -->|allow_recipient| BridgeList[[iMessage bridge allowlist<br/>on the Mac]]
    Approve -->|introduction from the<br/>capability list, exactly once| Welcome[Welcome message]

    Limits[(Redis attempt limits)] --> Request
    Limits --> Register
    Limits --> Login
    Register --> Accounts
    Login -->|Argon2id verification| Accounts
    Register --> Sessions[(Revocable sessions<br/>token digests only)]
    Login --> Sessions
    Sessions --> Cookie[Host-only HttpOnly cookie]

    Visitor -->|private request and cookie| Gate[Session and origin gate]
    Gate --> Sessions
    Gate -->|server-derived owner| Ownership[Owned API checks<br/>ownership answers who, scopes answer what]
    Ownership --> Data[(Chats, memory,<br/>artifacts and jobs)]
    Subscribers -.->|sender identity by digest| Bridge[iMessage chat worker]

    CLI -.->|disable or reset| Accounts
    CLI -.->|revoke| Sessions
    Entry -.->|logout| Sessions

    classDef actor fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    class Operator,Visitor actor;
    class CLI,Entry,Request,Approve,Register,Login,Cookie,Gate,Ownership,Welcome,Bridge application;
    class Invites,Requests,Accounts,Subscribers,Limits,Sessions,Data data;
    class BridgeList external;
